{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILD YOUR BLOB</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775960/extras/7cb35c61c198fd80b41be81c2b976a93.poster.avif?t=1769667145\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775960/extras/7cb35c61c198fd80b41be81c2b976a93.webm?t=1769667145\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775960/extras/7cb35c61c198fd80b41be81c2b976a93.mp4?t=1769667145\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Amalgun, every enemy can be knocked out and attached to. Use and experiment with a variety of different amalgoms, each with their own abilities and evolutions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775960/extras/2e0444727400a957f59a939d7972a9ce.poster.avif?t=1769667145\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775960/extras/2e0444727400a957f59a939d7972a9ce.webm?t=1769667145\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775960/extras/2e0444727400a957f59a939d7972a9ce.mp4?t=1769667145\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Match three amalgoms of the same type to merge and evolve them, providing unique upgrades to their powers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your blob grows and changes shape, you'll need to balance your size with survivability as you adapt to dash and twist around enemies. The ability to rotate and turn around attacks adds a unique dimension to a combat system that is easy to learn but hard to master.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ACCESSORIZE AND AUGMENT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775960/extras/b8185faa9c70c25de5da71aa6ffe1959.poster.avif?t=1769667145\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775960/extras/b8185faa9c70c25de5da71aa6ffe1959.webm?t=1769667145\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775960/extras/b8185faa9c70c25de5da71aa6ffe1959.mp4?t=1769667145\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find and buy accessories for your amalgoms to augment their abilities (and up their fashion). Further upgrade your build with a variety of perks to make a blob all your own.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TEAM UP</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775960/extras/0997eda1c9e2847871fac5428e811f81.poster.avif?t=1769667145\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775960/extras/0997eda1c9e2847871fac5428e811f81.webm?t=1769667145\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775960/extras/0997eda1c9e2847871fac5428e811f81.mp4?t=1769667145\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optionally bring friends into the fray with 2-4 player local and online co-op.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DISCOVER AMALGA</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your way through the world of Amalga. Encounter and track a variety of amalgom species, earn achievements and spend resources acquired during runs to unlock permanent upgrades, and use your wits and the powers of your amalgoms to uncover Amalga's secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775960/extras/00816b9826c5d2a891df3056fed83345.poster.avif?t=1769667145\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775960/extras/00816b9826c5d2a891df3056fed83345.webm?t=1769667145\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775960/extras/00816b9826c5d2a891df3056fed83345.mp4?t=1769667145\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With an assortment of amalgoms, accessories, and perks to try, every run is unique. Make a busted build and create chaos.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3775960?t=1769667145","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775960/23c90f5c941800414fe7798ed23f40bb1401475d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769667145","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775960/b6919cce0d997ed78d520e6050ecef34094fcb0c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769667145","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775960/b6919cce0d997ed78d520e6050ecef34094fcb0c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769667145","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILD YOUR BLOB</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775960/extras/7cb35c61c198fd80b41be81c2b976a93.poster.avif?t=1769667145\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775960/extras/7cb35c61c198fd80b41be81c2b976a93.webm?t=1769667145\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775960/extras/7cb35c61c198fd80b41be81c2b976a93.mp4?t=1769667145\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Amalgun, every enemy can be knocked out and attached to. Use and experiment with a variety of different amalgoms, each with their own abilities and evolutions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775960/extras/2e0444727400a957f59a939d7972a9ce.poster.avif?t=1769667145\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775960/extras/2e0444727400a957f59a939d7972a9ce.webm?t=1769667145\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775960/extras/2e0444727400a957f59a939d7972a9ce.mp4?t=1769667145\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Match three amalgoms of the same type to merge and evolve them, providing unique upgrades to their powers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your blob grows and changes shape, you'll need to balance your size with survivability as you adapt to dash and twist around enemies. The ability to rotate and turn around attacks adds a unique dimension to a combat system that is easy to learn but hard to master.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ACCESSORIZE AND AUGMENT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775960/extras/b8185faa9c70c25de5da71aa6ffe1959.poster.avif?t=1769667145\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775960/extras/b8185faa9c70c25de5da71aa6ffe1959.webm?t=1769667145\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775960/extras/b8185faa9c70c25de5da71aa6ffe1959.mp4?t=1769667145\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find and buy accessories for your amalgoms to augment their abilities (and up their fashion). Further upgrade your build with a variety of perks to make a blob all your own.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TEAM UP</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775960/extras/0997eda1c9e2847871fac5428e811f81.poster.avif?t=1769667145\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775960/extras/0997eda1c9e2847871fac5428e811f81.webm?t=1769667145\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775960/extras/0997eda1c9e2847871fac5428e811f81.mp4?t=1769667145\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optionally bring friends into the fray with 2-4 player local and online co-op.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DISCOVER AMALGA</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your way through the world of Amalga. Encounter and track a variety of amalgom species, earn achievements and spend resources acquired during runs to unlock permanent upgrades, and use your wits and the powers of your amalgoms to uncover Amalga's secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775960/extras/00816b9826c5d2a891df3056fed83345.poster.avif?t=1769667145\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775960/extras/00816b9826c5d2a891df3056fed83345.webm?t=1769667145\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775960/extras/00816b9826c5d2a891df3056fed83345.mp4?t=1769667145\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With an assortment of amalgoms, accessories, and perks to try, every run is unique. Make a busted build and create chaos.</p>","developers":["Knockout Mouse"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775960/2627a4de2512d5327ad18a661625bbe37302cb8c/header.jpg?t=1769667145","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3775960/211832531/df8d6df4ea853dc8ecc7dfe54af8df0d55f11247/1757223934/dash_av1.mpd?t=1757225523","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3775960/211832531/df8d6df4ea853dc8ecc7dfe54af8df0d55f11247/1757223934/dash_h264.mpd?t=1757225523","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3775960/211832531/df8d6df4ea853dc8ecc7dfe54af8df0d55f11247/1757223934/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1757225523","id":257194121,"name":"Announcement trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257194121/ccec180f3d3efdecdf7c9476959e973ba7e19c73/movie_600x337.jpg